# Pin the line endings of every signed text file, so that a fresh checkout on any platform
# (core.autocrlf=true or false) produces the same bytes.  verify_local_prune_rtl.py additionally
# hashes the canonical LF form, so the signature is verifiable even in a foreign working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.vcd text eol=lf
*.wdb binary
*.dcp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
*.xcf binary
